# Sentient Project Rules

## Brand

- Product name is **Sentient** in all user-facing copy (not Kindly).
- Repo: `Nejo12/sentient`. Handoff folder still says Kindly — adapt when building.

## Copy discipline

- en-GB, sentence case, warm second-person voice.
- No emoji. No exclamation marks (except inside quoted user messages).
- Never label anything "AI", "Generate", or "Magic".
- Moderation block copy: *"Something here needs another look."*
- Reassurance on Send-back: nothing sends automatically.

## v1 scope (do not add without approval)

- Intents: **What can I do?** / **What am I missing?**
- Understanding chips (do-path only): Calm, Confident, Curious, Compassionate, Firm, Professional
- Do NOT ship: Softer/Warmer chips, Apologise, Set boundary, Translate, custom keyboard (v1.1)

## Clarification gate

If a requirement is missing from `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-04-sentient-design.md`, **ask the user** — do not improvise.

